stock: phase 3: arbitrary terms to the name whose type is term; BEES sends each back
stock: term 0, {self(), make_ref(), a port, fun erlang:node/0, a local fun, atom_bees_never_saw_qqzx}: the echo =:= the original: true
stock: term 1, [1, -1, 2.5, 123456789012345678901234567890, {<<"bin">>, <<1:1>>}, #{k => [a|b]}, "str", [], [x]]: the echo =:= the original: true
stock: term 2, self(): the echo =:= the original: true
stock: term 3, make_ref(): the echo =:= the original: true
stock: term 4, #{a pid => [a reference, a reference], fun lists:map/2 => a port}: the echo =:= the original: true
stock: nodes() lists BEES: true
